<testcase>
  <info>
    <p>
      Markers that cannot be honoured are reported, each by its event, and ignored, and the page-sequence's own
      master applies: a page-sequence-master that is not one unbounded alternatives; a master whose body is wider;
      a master whose region-body is not named for the flow; a marker inside a table cell; and, last, no marker at
      all.
    </p>
  </info>
